==Chapters==
* ''[[ET16|You Bet Your Wife]]''

==Important events==
* [[Ash Ketchum (EToP)|Ash]] meets up with [[Misty]] again and meets [[Rudy]] and [[Mahri]].
* Ash challenges the [[Trovita Gym]] and wins. 
* Rudy begins crossdressing so that his little sister can have an older sister.

